== Crypto block v3 (2770 x 780, bottom-edge pins; final v2 floorplan slot)
  The first v2 shape (2770 x 810, pins on the 810 um left edge) put the
  AXI register/read-mux logic at one end of the block: HPWL +12 %,
  global-route wire 11.00 m vs 8.90 m, 7,873 overflowed gcells at
  74.9 % usage. With the pins on the bottom edge (v3): 0 overflow,
  68.3 % usage, 9.43 m.
  DRT (11 threads, restarted from the GRT result; earlier 2- and
  5-thread attempts were stopped for speed): 329,901 / 258,127 / 242,189 /
  111,676 / 62,001 / 40,519 / 30,200 / 24,469 / 18,713 (iteration 8,
  ~10 min per iteration), still falling ~20 % per iteration. Not
  finished when this log was written: the run (container
  pnr-hier-crypto-v3c, target generate_abstract) was left going on the
  host and records its end in ~/sigil-hier/build/STATUS; its route
  DRC / antenna / timing are therefore not reported here.

