== Reproduce (ORFS image above; design dirs mounted as in the flat run,
   plus flow/designs/sky130hd/sigil_hier at designs/sky130hd/sigil_hier)
  make DESIGN_CONFIG=designs/sky130hd/sigil_hier/sigil_crypto_top/config.mk FLOW_VARIANT=v2 generate_abstract
  make DESIGN_CONFIG=designs/sky130hd/sigil_hier/sigil_cpu/config.mk FLOW_VARIANT=v2 generate_abstract
  SIGIL_TOP_SYNTH=1 make DESIGN_CONFIG=designs/sky130hd/sigil_hier/config.mk FLOW_VARIANT=v2 synth
  make DESIGN_CONFIG=designs/sky130hd/sigil_hier/config.mk FLOW_VARIANT=v2 finish
  (block FLOW_VARIANT must match the top's: the top reads
  results/sky130hd/sigil_hier_<block>/$(FLOW_VARIANT)/.) Sizing runs
  override DIE_AREA/CORE_AREA on the make command line.

== Host disk
  The host disk filled up once during these runs (0 bytes free while
